<title>BAHRAIN: TABLE-Saudi Ceramics Co goes to red in H1 97.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Saudi Ceramics Co goes to red in H1 97.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>			  (million Saudi riyals)</p>
<p> Net loss		   1.4   vs   7.9 profit</p>
<p> Sales		     80.6   vs  71.2</p>
<p> Sales cost		61.8   vs  46.5</p>
<p> Operating income	18.8   vs  25.3</p>
<p> Other income	     0.7   vs   0.9</p>
<p> Expenses		  20.96  vs  18.22</p>
<p> Shareholders' funds  333.0   vs 332.1</p>
<p> Assets		   510.6   vs 416.1</p>
<p>Full Name: The Saudi Ceramics Company.</p>
<p>-- Bahrain newsroom 973-524424</p>
